en.description:
Description
We are looking for an experienced Senior Compliance Officer to join our Compliance team. The ideal candidate has extensive experience in the banking sector and a comprehensive understanding of compliance processes beyond Anti-Money Laundering (AML), including cross-border processes, sanctions, regulatory reporting, compliance risk assessment, and oversight of compliance-related projects.

Responsibilities
- Collaborate effectively with colleagues from various departments, including IT;
- Adopt a proactive and critical approach to identifying and implementing new solutions;
- Work independently and manage priorities autonomously;
- Manage a high volume of complex cases efficiently and accurately.

Requirements
- Minimum 3-5 years of experience in the banking sector in a role similar to that of a Compliance Officer.
- Proven experience not only in AML Compliance but also in:
- Cross-border processes, sanctions, and consolidated oversight of affiliates;
- Compliance reporting, training, and regulatory monitoring;
- Compliance risk assessment;
- Coordination and oversight of compliance-related projects.
- University degree in Law, Economics, or a related field.
- CAS in Compliance (Advanced Studies Certificate) or an equivalent professional qualification.
- Advanced proficiency in Microsoft Office, particularly Microsoft Excel.
- Strong team-oriented mindset and excellent problem-solving skills.
- Resident in Ticino or willing to relocate.

de.description:
